      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed dislocation mechanisms delay crack initiation and propagation relative to pure tungsten.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under high-temperature loading, the HEA exhibits greater plastic strain than pure tungsten.",
